    "Menstrual mode" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "وضع الحيض"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Menstrual mode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Menstrual mode is on, so the prayer, adhan and fasting reminders are paused until you turn it off." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "وضع الحيض مفعّل، فتذكيرات الصلاة والأذان والصيام متوقفة حتى توقفيه."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Menstrual mode is on, so the prayer, adhan and fasting reminders are paused until you turn it off."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On since %@. Prayers are logged as excused and their reminders are paused." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "مفعّل منذ %@. تُسجَّل الصلوات بعذر وتتوقف تذكيراتها."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On since %@. Prayers are logged as excused and their reminders are paused."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prayer and fasting are lifted from you in these days, and the door to Allah stays open. Here is what you can keep doing." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "رُفعت عنكِ الصلاة والصيام في هذه الأيام، وباب الله مفتوح. وهذا ما يمكنك الاستمرار فيه."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Prayer and fasting are lifted from you in these days, and the door to Allah stays open. Here is what you can keep doing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prayer reminders come back. If a prayer’s time is still running, it’s no longer marked as excused, so you can pray it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تعود تذكيرات الصلاة. وإن كان وقت صلاةٍ ما زال قائمًا، فلن تبقى مسجّلة بعذر لتصلّيها."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Prayer reminders come back. If a prayer’s time is still running, it’s no longer marked as excused, so you can pray it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prayer reminders pause" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تتوقف تذكيرات الصلاة"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Prayer reminders pause"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prayer times, “not logged yet”, the adhan and the fasting reminders. Your azkar reminders carry on." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "أوقات الصلاة و«لم تُسجَّل بعد» والأذان وتذكيرات الصيام. أما تذكيرات الأذكار فتستمر."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Prayer times, “not logged yet”, the adhan and the fasting reminders. Your azkar reminders carry on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prayers are marked as excused" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تُسجَّل الصلوات بعذر"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Prayers are marked as excused"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reading about the Quran, the hadith and the life of the Prophet ﷺ." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "القراءة في علوم القرآن والحديث وسيرة النبي ﷺ."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reading about the Quran, the hadith and the life of the Prophet ﷺ."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reciting the Quran" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تلاوة القرآن"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reciting the Quran"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholars differ over reciting the Quran during menstruation: many hold that it is not recited, while others allow it, especially from memory or to keep what was learnt. Most hold that the mushaf itself is not touched directly." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "اختلف العلماء في قراءة الحائض للقرآن: فكثير منهم يمنعها، وأجازها آخرون، لا سيما من الحفظ أو لتثبيت المحفوظ. وجمهورهم على أن المصحف لا يُمَسّ مباشرة."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholars differ over reciting the Quran during menstruation: many hold that it is not recited, while others allow it, especially from memory or to keep what was learnt. Most hold that the mushaf itself is not touched directly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Seeking forgiveness, and sending blessings on the Prophet ﷺ." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "طلب المغفرة، والإكثار من الصلاة على النبي ﷺ."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seeking forgiveness, and sending blessings on the Prophet ﷺ."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The prayers of these days are not made up. The fasts of Ramadan are made up later." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "الصلوات الفائتة في هذه الأيام لا تُقضى، أما صيام رمضان فيُقضى بعدها."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The prayers of these days are not made up. The fasts of Ramadan are made up later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The worship you can still do, one tap away on Today." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "العبادات التي يمكنك القيام بها، على بُعد لمسة في «اليوم»."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The worship you can still do, one tap away on Today."
          }
        }
      }
    },
